62
00:02:27,667 --> 00:02:30,200
<i> Gandang Gabi,
<i> Kapamilya </i> and <i> Kapuso!</i></i>

63
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:33,633
<i> Gandang Gabi,
<i> Kapamilya </i> and <i> Kapuso!</i></i>

64
