- How was your week, guys?

72
00:02:50,033 --> 00:02:51,067
Verna, how was your week?

73
00:02:51,067 --> 00:02:52,633
I've had a fun week, Meme.

74
00:02:52,633 --> 00:02:54,700
We celebrated
my son's birthday.

75
