77
00:02:58,267 --> 00:02:59,300
- [LAUGHTER]
- [SILLY SFX PLAYING]

78
00:02:59,300 --> 00:03:01,400
And the man didn't even know.

79
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,933
- Yeah!
- She got pregnant.

80
00:03:02,933 --> 00:03:06,700
Just with saliva. That's it.
Then her belly grew.

81
00:03:06,700 --> 00:03:08,467
It was your son's birthday.
You celebrated what?

82
00:03:08,467 --> 00:03:10,500
- Hhis second birthday.
- He knows you're his mother?

83
00:03:10,500 --> 00:03:11,600
Mm-hmm.

84
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:13,100
Do you think
it was a happy birthday?

85
00:03:13,100 --> 00:03:14,400
It was a happy birthday.

86
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:15,800
What are you saying?
You're a godmother.

87
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:18,000
Oh, gosh! I forgot
I'm his godmother!

88
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,633
[TETAY] Yeah, we both are.

89
00:03:19,633 --> 00:03:21,667
What did you do
for his birthday party?

90
00:03:21,700 --> 00:03:24,933
We went out.
Just a family outing.

91
00:03:24,933 --> 00:03:27,033
We went to the Manila Zoo.

92
00:03:27,033 --> 00:03:29,100
- Ah, really? How was it?
- In all fairness,

93
00:03:29,100 --> 00:03:31,067
