94
00:03:31,067 --> 00:03:33,667
Why do you have a free
entrance privilege there?

95
00:03:33,667 --> 00:03:34,900
I don't know either.

96
00:03:34,900 --> 00:03:36,700
Maybe they were like,
"Feel at home!"

97
00:03:36,700 --> 00:03:38,167
[LAUGHTER]

98
00:03:38,167 --> 00:03:40,867
The entrance was free
but we couldn't find the exit.

99
00:03:40,867 --> 00:03:42,067
